{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Dual Fire Walled City, experience their intense careers firsthand through split-screen local co-op or Steam Remote Play. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game delivers a gripping narrative with diverse missions and gameplay, allowing you and your partner to cooperate through an emotional journey\u2014just like playing through a classic Hong Kong crime thriller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Together with Steam Remote Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one copy of the game is needed\u2014invite a friend online via Steam Remote Play and dive into the story together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/351ddd33ebac79d2b8cf20c770e4ca9e.avif?t=1766383116\" width=912 height=154 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic Visual Style &amp; Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through nostalgic old tong lau buildings, neon-lit streets, and the modren concrete jungle\u2014all inspired by the gritty, glamorous look of classic Hong Kong action movies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Dual-Language Voiceover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features full voice acting in both <strong>Cantonese and Putonghua</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch freely between them to fully immerse yourself in the world of Dual Fire Walled City.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Thrilling Cinematic &amp; Cooperative Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the vibrant streets of Hong Kong and tackle thrilling missions together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/650759772a61c2a58a90b80d56494734.poster.avif?t=1766383116\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/650759772a61c2a58a90b80d56494734.webm?t=1766383116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/650759772a61c2a58a90b80d56494734.mp4?t=1766383116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every punch and kick lands with force</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The operation won\u2019t be easy; enemies won\u2019t go down without a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/714830353be6cb2984d9f07dbc0486fe.poster.avif?t=1766383116\" width=702 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/714830353be6cb2984d9f07dbc0486fe.webm?t=1766383116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/714830353be6cb2984d9f07dbc0486fe.mp4?t=1766383116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Multiple Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, you\u2019ll step into different roles\u2014even returning to their childhood \u2014to explore the famous memorable Kowloon Walled City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/2f9b258b34917a1ea8f9074cac7813c7.poster.avif?t=1766383116\" width=702 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/2f9b258b34917a1ea8f9074cac7813c7.webm?t=1766383116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/2f9b258b34917a1ea8f9074cac7813c7.mp4?t=1766383116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Variety of Nostalgic Mini-Games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alongside your partner and enjoy  our childhood favourite games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/e2ed3091ca2e626edfcff4942a049a83.poster.avif?t=1766383116\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/e2ed3091ca2e626edfcff4942a049a83.webm?t=1766383116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/extras/e2ed3091ca2e626edfcff4942a049a83.mp4?t=1766383116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story,all names,characters and incident portrayed in the production are fictitious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No identification with actual persons(living or dead),places,buildings or products is intended or should be inferred.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918200?t=1766383116","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918200?t=1766383116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/a3a782fa5068ff408b55d565758353240bc59e7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766383116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918200/a3a782fa5068ff408b55d565758353240bc59e7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766383116","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"descri